{"id":"vod_md_3001","vodId":"3001","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第二季","name_cn":"关于完全听不懂老公在说什么的事第二季","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230822-1/5d074d75aaba5651032a699dc9aeba0f.jpg"},"summary":"新的一年，搞怪夫妇们的故事继续上演。佐村薰炭（田村由香里 配音）快言快语，和她那死宅闷骚的老公十一（铃村健一 配音）似乎依然没有找到合拍的地方。老公对宅文化的热爱全面爆发，令她不胜其扰，两人对话时偶尔鸡同鸭讲。不过这又如何，已然成为夫妇，总会在不经意的地方发现小小的感动。与此同时，佐村夫妇经常和树濑望（坂井俊文 配音）及树濑理乃（钉宫理惠 配音）、山田（外崎大辅 配音）及田中（新谷良子 配音）这两对夫妇以及三木（清水香里 配音）和蛋黄蛋（堀野纱也加 配音）这对奇怪的组合结伴出行游玩。个性满满的朋友们点缀着彼此的生活……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-22 07:47:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/WzFd0GcD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/2emNOo1F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/clmmmuZ4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/q7BlOdXX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/IZbLnIpa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/GvJ5EUxB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/Vn3NL9lH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/62XDC6RQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/CZsjmDDB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/J33aCo5Y/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/kOEfErJM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/lj845u7r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/xhAd1zyo/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:51.295Z"}